{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223700/extras/daa46b815ed12515bf53508b41d043b5.poster.avif?t=1756975361\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223700/extras/daa46b815ed12515bf53508b41d043b5.webm?t=1756975361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223700/extras/daa46b815ed12515bf53508b41d043b5.mp4?t=1756975361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You think sloths are slow? Well, Eddy is here to prove you wrong. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Driftwood, you\u2019ll experience high-speed downhill longboarding as an aerodynamic sloth. Drifting is the name of the game, as it\u2019ll help you strike the perfect balance between speed and control. Drift through tight corners to avoid collision with cars and obstacles, and perform wicked tricks as you take in the beautiful landscape around you. These tricks will help you score points, which will unlock new boards that can be combined with various wheels for diverse skating styles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223700/extras/43e36d10c8163cfa72a0ce969f74a3c8.webp?t=1756975361\" width=627 height=57 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D</strong>ream of skating as a sloth? Look no further \u2013 Driftwood lets you enjoy flowy longboarding as Eddy, who will acquire new boards, wheels, and clothes that will enhance the experience.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong>ace through beautiful scenery with relaxing music as the backdrop. Focus on vibes and tricks \u2013 Driftwood has no story campaign or obligations.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I</strong>mmerse yourself in a contained world \u2013 Driftwood is not an open-world game; it\u2019s a focused, minimalist experience.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F</strong>un in solo or online with friends \u2013 Driftwood allows you to skate on your own, beat personal challenges and compare your runs in online leaderboards or host a lobby with up to 8 friends in the p2p multiplayer mode!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>T</strong>ravel to newly unlocked islands with your van \u2013 Driftwood has 15+ levels for you to skate and drift to your heart\u2019s content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small team consisting of just one artist and one programmer. We\u2019ve set out to make a game that provides an intense downhill longboarding experience without much fluff, just a focus on drifting and flow. While there are no freestyle skateboarding tricks in Driftwood, we hope you enjoy the content in our game!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Try out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2223700/a9f793a92fa057d98e414d7ccb745d00ce939ecf.jpg"},{"name":"In one piece","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2223700/3de8a1d63158d902f944770f35c524363a445b98.jpg"},{"name":"Fast learner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2223700/9d2079c4b9929d9ccef823db28b422f390b18b89.jpg"},{"name":"Eagle Stone Mountain 100%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2223700/9aa42aeb8552df425c88c128ada5439cfbac5128.jpg"},{"name":"Black Forest 100%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2223700/c04e87e2116ec3d836f8f3cd95ae6acd36f7b258.jpg"},{"name":"Vineyard Hills 100%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2223700/1750421cb18a937775ddc2561f98a87668c05728.jpg"},{"name":"Dolomites 100%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2223700/f3c4a012de8c2528dd1960982c55af7d5b595c47.jpg"},{"name":"Formal attire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2223700/cead2ecdae997830357db328abfff86a8ed71e8d.jpg"},{"name":"Pole dancer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2223700/6afbda1f90c55b84340ceb6f89b1c3379873ec72.jpg"},{"name":"You butter believe it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2223700/2016bf4cb01ddb3efec855e95945c185aa0c414a.jpg"}],"total":27},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2223700?t=1756975361","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223700/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756975361","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223700/654ddbf00e2e0b87f403182387f3e73eac86ea25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756975361","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223700/654ddbf00e2e0b87f403182387f3e73eac86ea25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756975361","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"no